}],"gloss":"green leaves","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாடா","parts":[{"text":"வாடா","lemma":"வாடா","gloss":"unfading"}],"gloss":"unfading","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வள்ளியம்","parts":[{"text":"வள்ளி","lemma":"vaḷḷi","gloss":"vaḷḷi creeper"},{"text":"அம்","lemma":"am","gloss":"euphonic increment"}],"gloss":"of the vaḷḷi creeper"},{"surface":"காடு","parts":[{"text":"காடு","lemma":"kāṭu","gloss":"forest"}],"gloss":"forest"},{"surface":"இறந்தோரே","parts":[{"text":"இறந்து","lemma":"iṟantu","gloss":"having crossed"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ōr","gloss":"he who"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"he who crossed indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"yāṉ","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"I indeed"},{"surface":"தோடார்","parts":[{"text":"தோடார்","lemma":"தோடார்","gloss":"fitting the shoulders"}],"gloss":"fitting the shoulders","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"எல்வளை","parts":[{"text":"எல்","lemma":"el","gloss":"brightness"},{"text":"வளை","lemma":"vaḷai","gloss":"bangle"}],"gloss":"bright bangles"},{"surface":"ஞெகிழ","parts":[{"text":"ஞெகிழ","lemma":"ñekiḦa","gloss":"to slip"}],"gloss":"to slip off"},{"surface":"ஏங்கி","parts":[{"text":"ஏங்கி","lemma":"ēṅki","gloss":"having lamented"}],"gloss":"having lamented"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பாடமை","parts":[{"text":"பாடு","lemma":"pāṭu","gloss":"suitability"},{"text":"அமை","lemma":"amai","gloss":"fitted"}],"gloss":"well-fitted"},{"surface":"சேக்கையில்","parts":[{"text":"சேக்கை","lemma":"cēkkai","gloss":"bed"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"locative suffix"}],"gloss":"in the bed"},{"surface":"படர்","parts":[{"text":"படர்","lemma":"paṭar","gloss":"grief"}],"gloss":"grief"},{"surface":"கூர்ந்திசினே","parts":[{"text":"கூர்ந்திசினே","lemma":"கூர்ந்திசினே","gloss":"I suffered intensely indeed"}],"gloss":"I suffered intensely indeed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அன்னள்","parts":[{"text":"அன்னள்","lemma":"aṉṉaḷ","gloss":"she of such nature"}],"gloss":"she is of such state"},{"surface":"அளியள்","parts":[{"text":"அளியள்","lemma":"aḷiyaḷ","gloss":"she who is pitiable"}],"gloss":"she is pitiable"},{"surface":"என்னாது","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"to think"},{"text":"ஆது","lemma":"ātu","gloss":"without doing"}],"gloss":"without thinking"},{"surface":"மாமழை","parts":[{"text":"மா","lemma":"mā","gloss":"dark"},{"text":"மழை","lemma":"maḻai","gloss":"cloud"}],"gloss":"the dark cloud"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னும்","parts":[{"text":"இன்னும்","lemma":"iṉṉum","gloss":"still further"}],"gloss":"still further"},{"surface":"பெய்ய","parts":[{"text":"பெய்ய","lemma":"peyya","gloss":"to rain"}],"gloss":"to rain"},{"surface":"முழங்கி","parts":[{"text":"முழங்கி","lemma":"muḻaṅki","gloss":"having thundered"}],"gloss":"having thundered"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மின்னும்","parts":[{"text":"மின்னு","lemma":"miṉṉu","gloss":"to flash"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"habitual relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"flashes"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"இன்னுயிர்","parts":[{"text":"இன்னுயிர்","lemma":"இன்னுயிர்","gloss":"sweet life"}],"gloss":"sweet life","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குறித்தே","parts":[{"text":"குறித்து","lemma":"kuṟittu","gloss":"aiming at"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"aiming at indeed"}]}],"literal":"He indeed, in order to bring imperishable excellent wealth, crossed the forest of unfading green-leaved vaḷḷi creepers / I indeed, lamenting as my bright bangles fitting my shoulders slipped off, suffered intense grief on my well-fitted bed / Without thinking 'she is of such state, she is pitiable', the dark cloud / still further thunders to rain / and flashes, O friend, aiming indeed at my sweet life.","translation":"He has crossed the forest of unfading green-leaved vaḷḷi creepers to bring back imperishable, noble wealth. But I, weeping as my bright bangles that once fit my shoulders slip away, lie on my comfortable bed, filled with deep grief. Without even thinking, 'She is in such a state, she is pitiable,' the dark cloud thunders to rain and flashes, O friend, aiming to take my sweet life.","modern":"அவர் அழியாத சிறந்த செல்வத்தைக் கொண்டுவருவதற்காக, பசுமையான இலைகளையுடைய வாடாத வள்ளிக் கொடிகள் நிறைந்த காட்டைத் தாண்டிச் சென்றுள்ளார். நானோ, தோள்களில் அணிந்திருந்த பிரகாசமான வளையல்கள் கழன்று விழும்படி அழுது வருந்தி, படுக்கையில் அமர்ந்து மிகுந்த துயரத்தை அடைகிறேன். தோழியே! 'இவள் இந்த நிலையில் இருக்கிறாளே, இவள் இரங்கத்தக்கவள்' என்று சிறிதும் நினையாமல், கரிய மேகமானது மேலும் மழை பொழியும்படி இடித்து மின்னுகிறது; அது என் இனிய உயிரைக் குறிவைத்தே அவ்வாறு செய்கிறது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend during the difficult period of separation from her lover. The hero has gone to distant lands to acquire wealth, crossing a lush forest of unfading vaḷḷi creepers. While he is away actively pursuing his goals, the heroine is left behind, wasting away in grief on her bed as her bangles slip off her thinning arms. The arrival of the rainy season, marked by thundering and flashing dark clouds, only intensifies her suffering. Instead of bringing relief, the monsoon clouds seem completely indifferent to her pitiable state, thundering and flashing as if deliberately targeting her fragile life.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,1.4],[1.4,1.7],[1.7,2.0],[2.0,3.3],[3.3,3.8],[3.8,4.2],[4.2,4.5],[4.5,5.4],[5.4,5.7],[5.7,5.9],[5.9,6.3],[6.3,7.2],[7.2,8.0],[8.0,8.5],[8.5,9.24],[9.24,9.61],[9.61,10.11],[10.11,10.6],[10.6,11.1],[11.1,11.6],[11.6,12.6],[12.6,12.9],[12.9,13.5],[13.5,14.1],[14.1,14.6],[14.6,15.1],[15.1,15.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.1],[2.1,2.62],[2.62,3.92],[3.92,4.33],[4.33,4.53],[4.53,4.73],[4.73,5.03],[5.03,5.44],[5.44,5.74],[5.74,6.15],[6.15,6.45],[6.45,6.96],[6.96,7.57],[7.57,7.87],[7.87,8.0],[8.0,12.2],[12.2,12.6],[12.6,13.2],[13.2,14.2],[14.2,14.6],[14.6,15.0],[15.0,16.0],[16.0,16.6],[16.6,17.1],[17.1,17.4]]},"sync":[[["அவரே","He indeed"]],[["கேடில்","imperishable"]],[["விழுப்பொருள்","excellent wealth"]],[["தருமார்","in order to bring"]],[["பாசிலை","green leaves"]],[["வாடா","unfading"]],[["வள்ளியம்","of the vaḷḷi creeper"]],[["காடு","forest"],["இறந்தோரே","he who crossed indeed"]],[["இறந்தோரே","he who crossed indeed"]],[["யானே","I indeed"]],[["தோடார்","fitting the shoulders"]],[["எல்வளை","bright bangles"]],[["ஞெகிழ","to slip off"]],[["ஏங்கி","having lamented"]],[["பாடமை","well-fitted"]],[["சேக்கையில்","in the bed"]],[["படர்","grief"],["கூர்ந்திசினே","I suffered intensely indeed"]],[["கூர்ந்திசினே","I suffered intensely indeed"]],[["அன்னள்","she is of such state"]],[["அளியள்","she is pitiable"]],[["என்னாது","without thinking"]],[["மாமழை","the dark cloud"]],[["இன்னும்","still further"]],[["பெய்ய","to rain"]],[["முழங்கி","having thundered"]],[["மின்னும்","flashes"]],[["தோழி","O friend"],["என்","my"]],[["இன்னுயிர்","sweet life"]],[["குறித்தே","aiming at indeed"]]]}